data: {"agent":"dsh","type":"thinking","text":"The user asks a one-sentence answer: a hardware keyboard with only 8 keys and one knob, what AI tool is it best suited for? This is a conceptual question, no tools needed. Answer in one sentence in Chinese.\n\nThink: 8 keys + 1 knob = macro pad / Stream Deck-like. Best AI tool: a physical shortcut console for quickly triggering AI workflows — e.g. 一键唤醒/切换 prompt 预设的 AI 快捷控制台 (like voice input + preset prompts + model switching). The knob for adjust/scroll/temperature.\n\nAnswer in one sentence."}

