event: turn
data: {"agent":"dsh","type":"thinking","text":"The user wants a summarization of two answers, in the specified three-section format.\n\nLet me analyze consensus: both agree it should be an AI shortcut/command console with 8 keys triggering one-click actions and the knob for continuous adjustment/selection/parameter tuning.\n\nDivergence: dsh emphasizes a static \"shortcut console\" with preset prompts/voice/model switching and knob for parameters like temperature/length/history; codex frames it as a \"workflow remote\" with task actions (voice input, translation, summarize, rewrite) and knob for selecting candidate results and adjusting params. Minor differences — dsh includes model switching and prompt-level control; codex emphasizes task-level actions and candidate selection. Essentially no fundamental contradiction, just emphasis. Also dsh mentions voice input both. The difference is more about positioning: input accelerator vs workflow controller. Could say there's no substantive conflict.\n\nRecommendation: pick codex's framing? Or a merge. Let me give an executable first step.\n\nOutput must not restate original text verbatim, no pleasantries. Keep concise."}

event: turn
data: {"agent":"dsh","type":"text","text":"## 共识\n双方都把这块硬件定位成\"物理快捷键 + 旋钮\"的 AI 操作面板：8 个按键承担一键触发，把语音输入、常用任务（如翻译/总结/改写）变成指尖动作；旋钮承担连续调节与选择，用来免鼠标地微调结果或参数。\n\n## 分歧\n没有实质矛盾，只是侧重不同：一方偏向\"输入与参数层\"的指令台，强调预设 prompt、模型切换，旋钮调温度/长度/历史；另一方偏向\"任务与结果层\"的遥控器，强调具体任务触发，旋钮主要用于在候选结果间选择。前者更像开发者/重度用户的控制面板，后者更像通用办公的流程遥控。\n\n## 建议\n落地推荐\"遥控器\"这一版，因为任务级动作（翻译、总结、改写、语音）通用性更强、学习成本更低，且旋钮用于\"选候选结果\"比调温度对普通用户更有即时价值；参数调节可以作为长按或第二层功能后置。第一步：先只做 8 个键的一键触发原型——把最常用的 4 个任务（语音输入、翻译、总结、改写）各占一键，另 4 键留空，旋钮先接\"候选结果切换\"，用一周真实使用数据决定剩下的键位分配。"}

